	It seems more often than not, when I'm fighting a tribe of orcs or 
some other nasty weapon-wielding monster that their final death blow always
seems to do about twice as much damage as their other blows.  E.g. I'm fight-
ing a hill orc wielding a scimitar, and each time he hits me it does somewhere
around 4-8 points of damage.  Then I get down to about 12 HP (I can't escape),
he hits me once more, and I die.  Are there any nethack rules saying that a
weapon could do extra damage if I'm low on hit points, or is Loki/Murphy just
screwing around with me?
